296
00:13:31,228 --> 00:13:33,295
Ini preskripsi.

297
00:13:33,318 --> 00:13:37,173
Ya, sila serahkan ini di farmasi.

298
00:13:37,197 --> 00:13:39,175
Baiklah.

299
00:13:39,198 --> 00:13:42,210
Saya akan kembalikan kad pemeriksaan anda.

300
00:13:42,234 --> 00:13:43,967
Terima kasih.

301
00:13:43,990 --> 00:13:47,285
Bagaimana dengan temujanji seterusnya?

302
00:13:47,309 --> 00:13:52,042
Doktor berkata apabila ubat sudah habis.

303
00:13:52,065 --> 00:13:55,102
